# Serra Paragon: "Once during each of your turns, you may play a land from your graveyard or cast a permanent spell with
# mana value 3 or less from your graveyard. If you do, it gains 'When this permanent is put into a graveyard from the
# battlefield, exile it and you gain 2 life.'" Faithless Looting discards Mishra's Workshop and Ornithopter. On turn 1 Bot1
# plays the Workshop from the graveyard, and the Ornithopter then can't be cast from there: the once is spent by the land.
# On turn 3 it is (the control). Bot2 destroys the Workshop with Wasteland and kills the Ornithopter with Lightning Bolt on
# turn 4: both are exiled instead of staying in the graveyard, and Bot1 gains 2 life for each.

